{"about_the_game":"The gates of Heaven are closed shut; the realm of Hell consumed by flood.<br />\r\nAnd in their wake, countless parallel worlds wither away, one after the other.<br />\r\nThe surviving angels and demons gather at the city they believe to be their final chance at salvation: the floating purgatory of &quot;Tokyo Babel&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJoined by humans, they embark on a pilgrimage across the seven layers of Babel, hoping to ascend Jacob's Ladder in an effort to re-open the gates of Heaven.<br />\r\nTheir journey would be an atonement toward the heavens.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd yet, their plans fall into ruin as a group of pilgrims - their minds consumed by madness - set out to lord over the numerous layers of Tokyo Babel with the intention to wreak complete and utter havoc atop the floating purgatory.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAmidst this neverending impasse, a lone youth is saved from the ruins of his devastated world - Tendou Setsuna, a man denied human treatment since birth.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJoining his savior, Lilith - known as the Witch of the Night, he begins his journey across Tokyo Babel...<br />\r\n<br />\r\n...yearning for an answer to a single question: <br />\r\nWhy he still possesses the will to keep on living.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/443380?t=1725518473","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/443380/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1725518473","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/443380/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1725518473","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/443380/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1725518473","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"T